id=\"disconnect\">Disconnect</button></p></div>`;\n    25\t    } else {\n    26\t      const why = st.status && st.status !== \"disconnected\" ? `<p class=\"muted\">Status: ${esc(st.status)}</p>` : \"\";\n    27\t      card = `<div class=\"card\">Intervals.icu is not connected.${why}\n    28\t        <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/api/intervals/auth/init\">Connect Intervals.icu</a></p></div>`;\n    29\t    }\n    30\t    root.className = \"\";\n    31\t    root.innerHTML = `<p>Signed in as <b>${esc(me.name)}</b>.</p>${card}`;\n    32\t    const d = document.getElementById(\"disconnect\");\n    33\t    if (d) d.onclick = async () => { await api(\"/api/intervals/disconnect\", { method: \"POST\" }); render(); };\n    34\t  } catch (e) {\n    35\t    root.innerHTML = `<p class=\"card\">Error: ${esc(e.message)}</p>`;\n    36\t  }\n    37\t}\n    38\t\n    39\trender();\n<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<title>tricoach</title>\n<style>\n  body { font: 15px/1.5 system-ui, sans-serif; margin: 2rem auto; max-width: 42rem; padding: 0 1rem; }\n  .btn { display: inline-block; padding: .5rem 1rem; border-radius: 6px; background: #1d4ed8; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; border: 0; cursor: pointer; }\n  .card { border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 8px; padding: 1rem; margin: 1rem 0; }\n  .muted { color: #666; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<h1>tricoach</h1>\n<div id=\"app\" class=\"muted\">Loading…</div>\n<script src=\"/static/app.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b0fb6539-8306-4def-bc57-954b92d4e42c","uuid":"1b94b171-ea1f-4896-8677-96b137ca3661","timestamp":"2026-10-20T23:23:39.766Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"logs:\ntotal 8\ndrwxr-xr-x 4 valentinakoniukhova wheel  128 Oct 20 20:23 .\ndrwx------ 8 valentinakoniukhova wheel  256 Oct 20 20:23 ..\n-rw-r--r-- 1 valentinakoniukhova wheel 2413 Oct 20 20:23 connect-attempt.log\n-rw-r--r-- 1 valentinakoniukhova wheel 1540 Oct 20 20:23 su